        "message": "=<p>Hello HR Team,</p>\n\n<p>A candidate has successfully passed the AI resume screening and has been shortlisted for the technical interview round.</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>📋 Candidate Details</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><b>Name:</b> {{ $('Candidate Registration Trigger').item.json[\"Question 1: Full Name \"] }}</li>\n  <li><b>Email:</b> {{ $('Candidate Registration Trigger').item.json[\"Question 2: Email Address \"] }}</li>\n  <li><b>Position:</b> {{ $json.Position }}</li>\n  <li><b>Experience:</b> {{ $('Candidate Registration Trigger').item.json[\"Question 5: Years of Experience \"] }}</li>\n  <li><b>AI Evaluation Score:</b> {{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.score }}/100</li>\n  <li><b>Decision:</b> {{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.decision }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>📝 AI Evaluation Summary</h3>\n\n<p>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.summary }}</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>💪 Key Strengths</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.strengths[0] }}</li>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.strengths[1] }}</li>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.strengths[2] }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>⚠️ Areas for Improvement</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.weaknesses[0] }}</li>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.weaknesses[1] }}</li>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.weaknesses[2] }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>🎯 Suggested Interview Questions</h3>\n\n<ol>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.interview_questions[0] }}</li>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.interview_questions[1] }}</li>\n  <li>{{ $('AI Resume Evaluator').item.json.output.interview_questions[2] }}</li>\n</ol>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p><b>Status:</b> Interview invitation has been sent to the candidate.</p>\n\n<p>\nRegards,<br>\n<b>AI Recruitment Platform</b><br>\nAutomated Hiring Workflow\n</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:gray;